+    On the one hand, due to
+    \begin{equation}
+       \label{eq:limit_delta_1}
+       \left\|\frac{\rho+\delta\sigma}{1+\delta}-\rho\right\|_1 \leq\left\|\frac{\delta}{1+\delta}\rho\right\|_1 + \left\|\frac{\delta}{1+\delta}\sigma\right\|_1 \leq 2\delta,
+    \end{equation}
