+RHS: (compoundMatrix M k * compoundMatrix N k) ⟨S,hS⟩ ⟨T,hT⟩ = ∑_U (compoundMatrix M k ⟨S,hS⟩ U) * (compoundMatrix N k U ⟨T,hT⟩) = ∑_U det(M.submatrix eS eU) * det(N.submatrix eU eT)
