+PROBLEM
+**Step 2**: S * (ρ_A ⊗ σ_BC⁻¹).reindex * S = I.
+  This follows from (ρ_A^{-½} * ρ_A * ρ_A^{-½}) ⊗ (σ_BC^½ * σ_BC⁻¹ * σ_BC^½) = I ⊗ I = I.
