+We need S * RHS.mat * S = 1 where S = (ρA⁻¹.sqrt.mat ⊗ₖ σBC.sqrt.mat).reindex(e,e) and RHS = (ρA ⊗ₖ σBC⁻¹).reindex(e) where e = (prodAssoc).symm and ρA = ρAB.traceRight.
